WEBVTT

00:00:01.480 --> 00:00:04.350
<b>Fujimiya Girls' High School</b>

00:00:08.790 --> 00:00:11.990
It's already been a month 
since school started.

00:00:11.990 --> 00:00:14.570
Hina-chan, have you gotten used to school?

00:00:14.570 --> 00:00:16.870
Yes, it's a lot of fun!

00:00:16.870 --> 00:00:19.860
Our theater society is still going on, too.

00:00:19.860 --> 00:00:22.870
I still don't do well 
in front of people, though...

00:00:23.300 --> 00:00:27.630
But I have you, Mayu-chan, 
Kuu-chan, and our landlady, too.

00:00:27.630 --> 00:00:29.030
And I've made friends...

00:00:29.630 --> 00:00:31.080
Yua-chan!

00:00:31.570 --> 00:00:32.880
M-Morn—

00:00:33.270 --> 00:00:34.410
...ing?

00:00:36.670 --> 00:00:38.140
Wh-What's with you?

00:00:39.410 --> 00:00:42.890
Hey, wait for me!

00:00:43.480 --> 00:00:46.180
Are they friends?

00:00:46.180 --> 00:00:48.020
Y-Yeah...

00:02:17.990 --> 00:02:22.990
<b>Scarecrow Heroine</b>

00:02:22.990 --> 00:02:24.700
<b>Theater Club</b>

00:02:23.650 --> 00:02:27.580
Okay, we'll begin our 
full practice in five minutes.

00:02:27.580 --> 00:02:30.930
Make sure you all do your warm-ups.

00:02:30.930 --> 00:02:32.080
Right!

00:02:32.080 --> 00:02:33.980
Is something wrong?

00:02:33.980 --> 00:02:37.340
Um, I'm just curious...

00:02:37.720 --> 00:02:41.860
Why is there a child in the club room?

00:02:41.860 --> 00:02:45.220
Come to think of it, she's been 
coming here for a few days.

00:02:46.840 --> 00:02:50.730
None of the other members 
have said anything...

00:02:51.000 --> 00:02:57.480
Actually, it seems like they've been practicing 
a lot harder these past few days...

00:02:57.480 --> 00:03:00.230
The landlady seems that way, too.

00:03:01.490 --> 00:03:04.990
Since she's standing next to 
the landlady, could she be...

00:03:05.490 --> 00:03:07.490
...a theater troupe relation?

00:03:08.560 --> 00:03:10.290
She's so well-developed!

00:03:10.290 --> 00:03:12.230
She's not the landlady's daughter, is she?!

00:03:12.230 --> 00:03:14.080
How old would she have
been when she had her?!

00:03:14.080 --> 00:03:15.570
Hey, you two!

00:03:15.570 --> 00:03:16.130
Eh?

00:03:16.130 --> 00:03:19.760
You really don't know who that is?

00:03:20.030 --> 00:03:21.240
Yua-chan...

00:03:21.240 --> 00:03:23.260
You know who that girl is?

00:03:24.220 --> 00:03:28.000
She's Kuroyanagi Ruriko, 
a famous child actress!

00:03:28.000 --> 00:03:30.010
You've never seen her on TV?

00:03:30.010 --> 00:03:31.920
N-No.

00:03:31.920 --> 00:03:33.270
<i>Now for our next story.</i>

00:03:31.920 --> 00:03:35.840
We only had three channels back home.

00:03:34.110 --> 00:03:35.790
<i>Here I come!</i>

00:03:35.840 --> 00:03:38.370
I guess you can't help that.

00:03:40.110 --> 00:03:43.080
Kuroyanagi Ruriko is only nine,

00:03:43.080 --> 00:03:45.050
but her acting rivals that of any adult.

00:03:45.050 --> 00:03:49.290
She's a super celebrity said to 
come along only once every century!

00:03:49.290 --> 00:03:53.670
The contrast between her cool personality 
and passionate acting is part of her charm!

00:03:53.950 --> 00:03:55.780
Ruri-chan, you're very cute.

00:03:55.780 --> 00:03:56.870
Want some candy?

00:03:56.870 --> 00:03:57.770
Eh?

00:03:57.770 --> 00:03:59.800
Were you even listening to me?!

00:04:00.240 --> 00:04:01.400
Sensei.

00:04:05.300 --> 00:04:07.050
<b>(Woman)Countess: Now, why don't we sing? To enjoy this night, this moment, the present.
Isn't that what people do?
-The countess looks around, giving Pino a menacing glare
(Man)Pino: But there is no heart here. How are we supposed to sing without heart? How are we supposed to enjoy that?
-Trio flinches slightly, but manages a word
(Woman)Countess: But there is heart.
-Delzoi, without losing heart
(Man)Delzoi: But where? I can't see it at all. You say something that doesn't exist, exists, 
and something that does exist, actually doesn't. You're quite difficult, aren't you?
-Countess, while giving a mysterious smile
(Woman)Countess: Right now... Right now, there isn't. There's no way there could be.
-Pino, interrupting
(Man)Pino: Then why is singing...
-Duchess, without any agitation</b>

00:04:05.550 --> 00:04:07.050
I'm Kuroyanagi Ruriko.

00:04:08.480 --> 00:04:13.600
I'm here as a special instructor 
to serve as this club's advisor.

00:04:13.600 --> 00:04:17.190
I returned to Japan recently 
after completing my theater training.

00:04:18.980 --> 00:04:23.110
Does that mean she's 
the advisor we heard about?

00:04:23.110 --> 00:04:27.830
Which means it's her fault the
 theater club was forced into hiatus, right?

00:04:27.830 --> 00:04:29.690
Hey, Kuu-chan!

00:04:29.690 --> 00:04:31.370
Hey! You can't—

00:04:31.370 --> 00:04:33.540
No, she is right.

00:04:33.540 --> 00:04:37.750
I cast aside my job 
as this theater club's advisor.

00:04:38.190 --> 00:04:43.490
At that time, I was beginning to lose 
my confidence and motivation

00:04:43.490 --> 00:04:47.010
to teach and guide 
all of you as your advisor.

00:04:47.010 --> 00:04:48.400
Wow...

00:04:48.400 --> 00:04:50.640
Hard to believe she's nine years old.

00:04:50.640 --> 00:04:55.140
So I went overseas to 
learn theater from square one.

00:04:55.520 --> 00:04:59.740
The Palais Garnier, La Scala, 
the Vienna State Opera...

00:04:59.740 --> 00:05:04.030
I visited theaters in many countries,
 and met many people.

00:05:04.340 --> 00:05:05.520
In doing so,

00:05:05.520 --> 00:05:09.530
I learned what is most important 
as both an actor and a teacher.

00:05:10.480 --> 00:05:11.790
Amazing!

00:05:12.120 --> 00:05:15.080
And so, I returned to Japan.

00:05:15.560 --> 00:05:19.420
Now is the time to show 
the fruits of my training.

00:05:19.420 --> 00:05:21.180
Wh-Where?

00:05:21.180 --> 00:05:23.300
On TV? In movies?

00:05:24.790 --> 00:05:25.800
No.

00:05:26.530 --> 00:05:29.550
In this theater club's performance 
at the upcoming culture festival.

00:05:30.740 --> 00:05:33.220
After you went all the way 
to Europe to train?

00:05:33.220 --> 00:05:36.310
Yes. I went there to train as 
an advisor, and nothing more.

00:05:36.310 --> 00:05:39.850
The culture festival is in one month, right?

00:05:39.850 --> 00:05:41.320
That soon?!

00:05:52.260 --> 00:05:54.640
Aki-chan, let's eat lunch.

00:05:54.640 --> 00:05:55.450
Sure.

00:05:55.970 --> 00:05:59.210
Oh, so the club's advisor is back?

00:05:59.210 --> 00:06:02.340
So it'll go back to being 
the theater club again?

00:06:02.340 --> 00:06:03.210
No...

00:06:03.850 --> 00:06:06.880
She said she had some things to think about,

00:06:06.880 --> 00:06:10.240
so she wants it to remain 
a society for the culture festival.

00:06:10.240 --> 00:06:11.720
I see...

00:06:12.080 --> 00:06:15.330
But the members must be 
really psyched up, right?

00:06:15.330 --> 00:06:15.970
Yeah.

00:06:16.910 --> 00:06:17.980
I am, too.

00:06:21.040 --> 00:06:23.860
I'd love to see Hina-chan 
and the Kuu-chan practicing!

00:06:25.100 --> 00:06:26.240
In the club room?

00:06:26.240 --> 00:06:31.010
Yeah! She practices in her room 
every day, right?

00:06:31.010 --> 00:06:34.320
Like her vocal practices with Kuu-chan.

00:06:34.320 --> 00:06:35.870
And stretches...

00:06:36.310 --> 00:06:37.940
I know she's working hard,

00:06:37.940 --> 00:06:40.920
so I want to see the results 
of that firsthand.

00:06:40.920 --> 00:06:43.000
Well, okay...

00:06:54.670 --> 00:06:57.270
Sh-She's not getting it at all.

00:07:01.890 --> 00:07:04.270
Mayu-chan!

00:07:05.720 --> 00:07:09.280
Hina-chan... you were able 
to do it at home...

00:07:09.580 --> 00:07:13.280
There are so many club members, 
it makes me nervous...

00:07:13.280 --> 00:07:15.390
I understand, but...

00:07:15.390 --> 00:07:16.030
I know!

00:07:16.480 --> 00:07:20.760
You know how they say to imagine people 
as vegetables when you're nervous?

00:07:20.760 --> 00:07:22.140
Vegetables?

00:07:22.140 --> 00:07:24.290
Like pumpkins, or daikon...

00:07:26.320 --> 00:07:28.670
Daikon? Pumpkins?

00:07:34.070 --> 00:07:37.680
Pumpkin-kin-kin-kin!

00:07:38.490 --> 00:07:40.540
Mayu-chan, I'm scared!

00:07:40.540 --> 00:07:41.940
Yeah...

00:07:42.290 --> 00:07:44.190
Okay, one more time.

00:07:47.110 --> 00:07:50.940
What should I do? If I freeze up again...

00:07:52.350 --> 00:07:55.320
Shouldn't you use these steps for this song?

00:08:24.750 --> 00:08:26.900
Mayu-chan, you're such a good dancer!

00:08:26.900 --> 00:08:28.780
That should work, I think.

00:08:31.260 --> 00:08:32.900
You're good!

00:08:32.900 --> 00:08:35.330
I-I'm g-g-going—

00:08:35.330 --> 00:08:37.050
Join our performance!

00:08:37.050 --> 00:08:40.160
A girl as cute as you 
will become a star in no time!

00:08:40.160 --> 00:08:45.790
I-I'm not good at that 
sort of... I mean... um...

00:08:47.220 --> 00:08:50.050
She caught Hina-chan's scarecrow problem.

00:08:51.360 --> 00:08:52.800
I'll be going...

00:08:58.050 --> 00:09:01.540
I-I'm sorry! I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

00:09:00.500 --> 00:09:02.310
No, that's all right.

00:09:03.590 --> 00:09:06.810
I know you're all practicing, 
but please stop for a moment.

00:09:07.410 --> 00:09:11.030
There's something 
I'd like all of you to hear.

00:09:21.080 --> 00:09:22.460
What are you doing?!

00:09:22.460 --> 00:09:24.770
The advisor has something to say!

00:09:24.770 --> 00:09:26.580
No, I don't mind.

00:09:26.580 --> 00:09:27.350
Eh?

00:09:31.720 --> 00:09:33.460
Please play this.

00:09:43.780 --> 00:09:44.840
This is...

00:09:46.280 --> 00:09:47.650
You can sing it, right?

00:09:48.360 --> 00:09:51.360
Huh? Uh, yes...

00:09:51.360 --> 00:09:52.420
Huh?

00:09:54.690 --> 00:09:56.610
All right, from the top.

00:10:10.670 --> 00:10:16.580
Walking home on a starry night

00:10:16.580 --> 00:10:21.970
All alone, I start to cry

00:10:21.970 --> 00:10:23.750
She's amazing!

00:10:21.970 --> 00:10:28.420
I'll softly wipe my tears away,

00:10:24.210 --> 00:10:25.230
Yeah...

00:10:28.420 --> 00:10:33.770
Then look up at the light and start walking

00:10:33.770 --> 00:10:35.820
Shining star!

00:10:35.820 --> 00:10:40.650
My eyes, when they begin to sparkle,

00:10:40.650 --> 00:10:45.280
Are just like the stars

00:10:45.280 --> 00:10:55.130
Yes, born to make my dream shine!

00:10:55.130 --> 00:11:03.770
Shining star!

00:11:13.600 --> 00:11:16.020
U-Um...

00:11:16.020 --> 00:11:17.630
Amazing!

00:11:17.630 --> 00:11:19.310
Hina-chan, you're a great singer!

00:11:19.310 --> 00:11:20.900
Your voice is so pretty!

00:11:20.900 --> 00:11:24.050
U-Um... really?

00:11:24.050 --> 00:11:25.530
Yes, really!

00:11:25.530 --> 00:11:27.910
I... I see...

00:11:28.450 --> 00:11:31.890
Maybe it's because I always sang

00:11:31.890 --> 00:11:35.090
"La, la, la, la" to call red foxes back home?

00:11:38.520 --> 00:11:40.960
I've been wondering...

00:11:40.960 --> 00:11:44.370
What part of the country 
did Hina-chan come from?

00:11:44.370 --> 00:11:45.970
Somewhere up north?

00:12:06.140 --> 00:12:06.740
Okay!

00:12:09.010 --> 00:12:11.650
Here's your black tea and coffee.

00:12:15.010 --> 00:12:17.920
Thanks for helping me 
this morning, Hina-chan.

00:12:17.920 --> 00:12:18.780
Not at all.

00:12:18.780 --> 00:12:23.130
As a resident of Hitotose Manor, 
I need to work, too.

00:12:23.130 --> 00:12:25.250
We don't have many customers yet.

00:12:25.250 --> 00:12:27.800
You don't have to work so hard.

00:12:32.290 --> 00:12:35.200
There are no customers left.

00:12:35.200 --> 00:12:38.640
I think we should have 
some more around lunch time.

00:12:40.280 --> 00:12:41.660
Aki-chan!

00:12:41.660 --> 00:12:43.280
Hey, are you free right now?

00:12:45.170 --> 00:12:48.440
Want to go get ice cream 
from the place by the station?

00:12:48.440 --> 00:12:51.410
Sorry... I'm going to a play.

00:12:51.830 --> 00:12:54.230
Aww, again?

00:12:54.230 --> 00:12:57.420
Yeah. I finally grabbed an empty seat.

00:12:57.420 --> 00:13:00.090
You should hang out with me sometimes!

00:13:00.090 --> 00:13:03.300
Which is more important 
to you, me or theater?

00:13:03.300 --> 00:13:04.820
There, there.

00:13:05.300 --> 00:13:08.350
Take care of the coffee shop for me, okay?

00:13:09.550 --> 00:13:12.950
W-Welcome...

00:13:12.950 --> 00:13:15.330
Okay, I'll be going now.

00:13:29.130 --> 00:13:31.200
Thank you very much.

00:13:31.200 --> 00:13:32.900
Th-Thank—

00:13:37.210 --> 00:13:40.980
We had more lunch customers than usual.

00:13:40.980 --> 00:13:42.820
You were a big help, Hina-chan.

00:13:42.820 --> 00:13:43.710
Not at all.

00:13:47.170 --> 00:13:49.360
Aki-chan's late...

00:13:56.730 --> 00:13:58.030
Come here!

00:13:58.030 --> 00:13:59.590
What are you doing?

00:13:59.590 --> 00:14:01.760
I thought maybe you wanted attention!

00:14:01.760 --> 00:14:04.730
Eh? Don't treat me like a baby!

00:14:09.460 --> 00:14:12.870
Did you want to spend time 
with the landlady today?

00:14:12.870 --> 00:14:16.340
Then you should've just 
gone to the play with her.

00:14:16.340 --> 00:14:17.910
Well, there's the shop...

00:14:17.910 --> 00:14:20.140
And I guess you can't 
leave me in charge, huh?

00:14:20.140 --> 00:14:22.790
I'm not interested in theater, anyway.

00:14:22.790 --> 00:14:26.610
Besides, the small theater troupe 
Aki-chan went to see today

00:14:26.610 --> 00:14:28.710
only does horror shows.

00:14:28.710 --> 00:14:32.210
And their lead actress 
always acts so realistically

00:14:32.210 --> 00:14:36.770
that a lot of people say they can't sleep 
the night after seeing her.

00:14:36.770 --> 00:14:39.690
Wow, you know a lot about it, 
huh, Mayu-chan?

00:14:40.730 --> 00:14:42.490
I-I do not!

00:14:42.490 --> 00:14:45.070
I just got curious 
and looked into it a little!

00:14:45.070 --> 00:14:49.070
Isn't that what they call "being interested"?

00:14:49.510 --> 00:14:52.320
If I had to say whether I'm 
interested or not, maybe I am...

00:14:52.320 --> 00:14:55.770
But theater is all Aki-chan ever talks about.

00:14:56.830 --> 00:14:59.680
Maybe you're just at a difficult age.

00:14:59.680 --> 00:15:02.330
I told you not to treat me like a baby!

00:15:05.570 --> 00:15:07.940
Something smells tasty.

00:15:07.940 --> 00:15:09.380
Is that lunch?

00:15:09.380 --> 00:15:11.840
Sorry it's a little late.

00:15:11.840 --> 00:15:13.480
Let's have lunch.

00:15:13.480 --> 00:15:15.390
Don't mind if I do!

00:15:16.700 --> 00:15:20.240
By the way, what were you having 
so much fun talking about?

00:15:20.240 --> 00:15:22.400
Oh, you could hear us?

00:15:22.400 --> 00:15:24.270
Just faintly.

00:15:24.270 --> 00:15:26.210
Well... um...

00:15:26.210 --> 00:15:29.140
The landlady is infatuated with theater,

00:15:29.140 --> 00:15:32.620
and, um... Mayu-chan wanted to get 
some ice cream by the station,

00:15:32.620 --> 00:15:36.400
and Mayu-chan isn't interested in theater...

00:15:36.400 --> 00:15:39.410
Huh? I'm not really sure anymore...

00:15:39.410 --> 00:15:42.870
Hey! You don't have to talk about that!

00:15:42.870 --> 00:15:43.920
Hmm...

00:15:44.480 --> 00:15:49.970
So basically, she's jealous of theater because 
the landlady never has time for her, right?

00:15:49.970 --> 00:15:51.430
What? Really?

00:15:51.430 --> 00:15:53.430
How'd you figure it out from that?!

00:15:57.200 --> 00:16:04.370
Wait, is that the reason why you said 
you didn't want to be in theater?

00:16:04.370 --> 00:16:04.940
Yeah.

00:16:05.350 --> 00:16:08.260
When it comes to theater,

00:16:08.260 --> 00:16:10.440
Aki-chan loses sight of everything else.

00:16:10.440 --> 00:16:12.550
Yeah, she really does love it.

00:16:12.550 --> 00:16:15.070
And the club's advisor just came back, too.

00:16:15.560 --> 00:16:20.330
Yeah, I'm happy that she's motivated 
again because of that...

00:16:21.580 --> 00:16:26.050
But that also means she pays 
no attention to me at all.

00:16:26.050 --> 00:16:29.960
That's why I wish she wouldn't 
get so absorbed in theater...

00:16:30.350 --> 00:16:32.720
A maiden's heart is a complex thing.

00:16:33.100 --> 00:16:34.180
Okay, got it.

00:16:34.180 --> 00:16:37.300
We'll fill that hole in your heart.

00:16:44.740 --> 00:16:45.920
Come here!

00:16:45.920 --> 00:16:48.860
Why are you both doing that?!

00:16:56.030 --> 00:16:58.460
The landlady sure is late getting back.

00:16:58.460 --> 00:17:00.120
And she just left the shop like that!

00:17:00.120 --> 00:17:02.540
When she gets back, 
I'm gonna let her have it!

00:17:03.650 --> 00:17:06.370
The landlady isn't obligated 
to work here, is she?

00:17:08.430 --> 00:17:09.730
I'm back.

00:17:09.730 --> 00:17:11.250
Aki-chan, you're late!

00:17:11.630 --> 00:17:12.840
Sorry.

00:17:12.840 --> 00:17:16.010
Um, I brought this back as a gift.

00:17:18.760 --> 00:17:21.060
It's from the place by the station...

00:17:21.060 --> 00:17:23.290
You remembered!

00:17:23.290 --> 00:17:25.760
Sorry I haven't had time to hang out lately.

00:17:25.760 --> 00:17:27.820
Let's have ice cream together.

00:17:27.820 --> 00:17:28.810
Yeah!

00:17:30.900 --> 00:17:31.820
You like it?

00:17:32.280 --> 00:17:33.310
Yeah!

00:17:33.310 --> 00:17:36.060
They're like a mother and child. 
How heartwarming.

00:17:36.060 --> 00:17:38.850
They look like some goofy couple to me.

00:17:49.960 --> 00:17:50.840
As you can see,

00:17:50.840 --> 00:17:54.960
in each country, theater is searching 
for new forms of expression.

00:17:55.300 --> 00:17:58.710
We need to polish our acting every day

00:17:58.710 --> 00:18:01.350
so we don't fall behind, either.

00:18:01.350 --> 00:18:04.440
The results of your studies abroad 
are pretty amazing.

00:18:04.440 --> 00:18:06.100
That's not all.

00:18:06.750 --> 00:18:10.940
Studying abroad greatly 
stimulated my creative urges,

00:18:10.940 --> 00:18:12.760
so I wrote these scripts.

00:18:12.760 --> 00:18:13.890
That many?!

00:18:13.890 --> 00:18:15.360
Impressive...

00:18:15.360 --> 00:18:18.530
This is the greatest masterpiece of them all.

00:18:18.530 --> 00:18:21.780
We will perform this at the culture festival.

00:18:18.910 --> 00:18:21.780
<b>And Everyone Is Part of 
the ABC Tragedy Case File!</b>

00:18:23.580 --> 00:18:25.410
This could be my chance!

00:18:25.650 --> 00:18:30.290
<i>Yeah! If I'm chosen to play 
the heroine in this masterpiece...</i>

00:18:48.770 --> 00:18:50.070
You, there.

00:18:50.070 --> 00:18:51.690
Would you like to play the heroine?

00:18:51.690 --> 00:18:53.620
Yes! I'd love to!

00:18:55.170 --> 00:18:56.440
You meant her?!

00:18:56.440 --> 00:19:01.200
M-M-Me? The heroine?

00:19:01.490 --> 00:19:03.700
Yes. You are the heroine.

00:19:03.700 --> 00:19:05.950
What?!

00:19:05.950 --> 00:19:07.830
